====Usage notes====
* The conjugation of this verb differs from {{m|it|vedere}} in two ways: (1) The future and conditional have alternative regular forms {{m|it|[[mi]] [[ravvederò]]}} etc. as well as {{m|it|[[mi]] [[ravvedrò]]}}; (2) The form {{m|it|ravveduto}} is the normal past participle, while {{m|it|ravvisto}} is archaic.

